<Project>

  <!--
    Deliberately empty, and the point of the project.

    The repository's own Directory.Build.props turns the interceptor namespace on for every
    project under it. That is right for projects that reference the library by project — and it
    is also what hid the packaged copy of that opt-in going missing, because every project here
    went on building without it. Stopping the import chain here means this project is told
    nothing by the repository and everything by the package, which is the consumer's position.
  -->

</Project>
